<title>FRANCE: Club Med has no comment on Monde report.</title>
<headline>Club Med has no comment on Monde report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Club Mediterranee declined to comment on Friday on a newspaper report that its board was about to unseat chairman Serge Trigano and appoint Euro Disney head Philippe Bourguignon in his place.</p>
<p>&quot;A board meeting is scheduled for this afternoon. A statement will be released after the meeting,&quot; a spokesman told Reuters. He declined to comment further.</p>
<p>The company earlier requested a suspension of its shares.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
